**Where to go:** Level 2–3 security mission agents (Business → Agents → Security → Level 2 or 3). Amarr Empire has plenty of agents near the major trade hub. Level 2 agents need no standing. Level 3 need ~3.0 standing — earned by completing ~20–30 level 2 missions for that same corporation.

