The primary ISK earner until Omega. Level 3 missions comfortably, level 4 missions with care. Five medium lasers plus missile secondary and heavy drones.

**Where to go:** Level 3–4 security mission agents in Amarr Empire space (Domain, Tash-Murkon, Khanid regions all have good agents near Amarr station). For level 3: need ~3.0 standing. For level 4: need ~5.0 standing — build this by running level 3 missions for the same corporation consistently. Each level 3 mission pays ~5–15M ISK plus bounties. A full session of L3 missions in the Harbinger earns 60–100M/hr.

**Why this is the priority ship:** At ~82M total fit, it earns back its own cost in roughly 1 hour. Every session in this ship banks meaningful ISK toward Omega.

