| Heat Sink II | ×2 | 2M ea — 4M |
| Large Armor Repairer II | ×1 | 6M |
| Rigs ×3 | | 500K ea — 1.5M |
| Ogre II | ×5 | 600K ea — 3M |
| **Hull (Paladin — T2 Marauder)** | | **1.6B** |
| **Total** | | **~1.72B ISK** |

> T2 Marauder — no BPO. ✅ **LD can make:** all three rigs only. At 200–400M/hr, this ship pays back inside 5–10 hours of missions.

Activate Bastion → shoot everything at 40+ km with Scorch L → Bastion expires after 60 sec → reposition → reactivate. During Bastion you cannot be scrambled — you are completely safe from tackles.

